        "text": "§\n\nWhat adverse reaction can occur 7-10 days after administering Rituximab?",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nWhat adverse reaction can occur 7-10 days after administering Rituximab?\n\nSerum sickness\n\n(Type III hypersensitivity reaction, can also occur with Cetuximab, but far less often)\n\n[Image: 7dfbf37846df40371aee1a3f2770f817a93a3a26bb2fa21949739707d2262ffb]\n\n[Image: 6e0574262c58826e26a71c16d7dfc1de8aacb127c58d3e4d472915358a8c207d]\n\n3.2 - Rituximab, cetuximab, bevacizumab, alemtuzumab, trastuzumab\n[Image: 78a3e5812b6b01cdf56b21c2dfa38b5f9a0a529350b6e0f9cec1fbc74081ae53]\n\n[Image: 9b62b45e65e980af4dabaab4824877160f66c7b4451ec31f26902f9f7b7dc09c]\n\n[Image: 77764fe2fafd0c5b5cc932c05fed9c385f31db6a88a3a2ea8cc6861ff68bf055]\n\n[Image: 187e7892c5c87c734265e9ff1612493208af791f9bdb0878077012f6a004fcc9]\n\n[Image: 0e4e85539937cdc2a012cad4670c08900808f5a50a54ce2895e466b08f771374]",
